findings.suggestion:
Restore the removed wildcard reply filtering logic. Add back the check before deserialization:

```typescript
if (
  this.options?.wildcards &&
  this.isOwnReply(channel, pattern, rawMessage)
) {
  return;
}
```

And restore the `isOwnReply` method:

```typescript
private isOwnReply(
  subscription: string,
  channel: string,
  message: Record<string, any>,
) {
  const replySuffix = this.getReplyPattern('');
  return (
    channel.endsWith(replySuffix) &&
    !subscription.endsWith(replySuffix) &&
    !isUndefined(message?.id) &&
    isUndefined(message?.pattern)
  );
}
```

